   <conbody class="- topic/body  concept/conbody " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/overview.dita" xtrc="conbody:1;25:13">
      <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/overview.dita" xtrc="p:1;26:10">After the SMS is configured and installed on a motor, it begins sending data from its on-board sensors to the ADI OtoSense™ Server and initiates a learning process. During this learning process, the analytics create a unique, customized model of the motor whose data is received. At regular intervals, the SMS sends a 2.4 second sample of all sensor data to the ADI OtoSense™ Server.</p>
      <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/overview.dita" xtrc="p:2;27:10">
