      </p>
      <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/overview.dita" xtrc="p:3;35:10">After the learning mode, the ADI OtoSense™ Server uses the baseline model to detect motor performance anomalies and generate alerts about impending motor issues.</p>
   </conbody>
